Portions derived from rawmakase
-------------------------------
The Star-Tetrix lifting steps, the 5/3 wavelet and the transfer curve in
crates/core/src/frame.rs (and their GPU versions in crates/core/src/gpu/) follow the Nikon
HE / HE* decoder of rawmakase (https://github.com/pch/rawmakase):

  Copyright (c) 2026 RAWmakase contributors
  Licensed under the MIT License; the full license text is in LICENSES/rawmakase-MIT.txt.

