Third-party dependencies
------------------------
Binary builds include Rust crates (Tauri, rayon, objc2, cudarc and their dependencies)
under their own permissive licenses, mostly MIT and/or Apache-2.0. A full list can be
generated with `cargo tree` or a tool such as cargo-about.
